1. Access Reference Project
- Log in to Jama.
- Navigate to Change Projects → Reference Projects.
- Select PL Safeco Property HMR3 Franchise.
2. Duplicate SOFAs
- Click on Reuse Items.
- Duplicate the required SOFAs.
- Select the target state ID for duplication.
3. Populate State-Specific Data
- Navigate to Change Product and select the target state.
- Refer to the provided wiki-page documentation.
- Copy the required data into the duplicated SOFAs/SODAs.
4. Create Filters & Dashboard
- Create the required filters.
- Configure the dashboard using the filters.
- Complete the state-specific setup and validation.
